oving from the first drop to the last beat. Known for his sharp mixing skills, unique sound transitions, and ability to read any room, DJ Twise has carved out a reputation as one of the most dynamic DJs on the scene.\\nWith a passion for music that goes beyond the decks, DJ Twise isn\\u2019t just about playing songs \\u2014 he curates experiences. From exclusive listening parties and upscale clubs to major festivals, his sets are built to leave a lasting impression and bring people together on the dancefloor.\\nDriven, creative, and always ahead of the wave, DJ Twise is not just spinning records \\u2014 he\\u2019s shaping the future of sound.\",\"created\":\"1638769601\",\"facebook\":\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/djtwiseofficial\",\"followers_count\":209860,\"genre\":\"afrobeats\",\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/djtwise\\/dadd4c074d.webp\",\"image_banner\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/djtwise\\/5340404247.webp\",\"image_base\":\"https:\\/\\/i.audiomack.com\\/djtwise\\/dadd4c074d.webp\",\"instagram\":\"\",\"label\":\"Twise Records\",\"linktree\":\"https:\\/\\/linktr.ee\\/djtwise\",\"location\":{\"tag\":\"nigerialagos\",\"display\":\"Lagos, Nigeria\"},\"name\":\"Dj Twise\",\"status\":\"active\",\"tiktok\":\"http:\\/\\/tiktok.com\\/@officialdjtwise\",\"twitter\":\"\",\"type\":\"artist\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/linktr.ee\\/djtwise\",\"url_slug\":\"djtwise\",\"usertags\":\"\",\"verified\":\"authenticated-pending\",\"youtube\":\"https:\\/\\/youtube.com\\/@officialdjtwise\"},\"url_slug\":\"amapiano-mixtape-vol2\",\"usertags\":\"amapiano,party,happy,nigerialagos\",\"volume_data\":\"[57,48,65,68,76,81,76,61,63,60,53,58,68,69,75,92,70,67,77,61,71,74,68,66,76,68,87,100,96,93,68,56,61,61,63,64,62,59,44,50,37,53,61,65,61,62,74,72,70,64,71,59,68,65,47,73,72,61,55,48,58,73,79,82,59,64,72,74,76,69,58,66,73,77,75,67,57,56,65,53,73,64,64,58,65,71,58,67,72,61,66,45,63,59,73,60,66,61,54,60,68,70,52,66,69,70,80,82,72,81,64,58,68,83,81,63,86,80,65,58,51,62,58,48,55,75,80,81